---LINES
---SCREEN
=attributes (video) settings
                                  
  ." logical type of lines: "................    
                                                                        
  CMD - initial text mode (restored on exit)      change a focus of editing               
  TXT - text (comment)                            betwwen 2 sets of attributes
  HDR - header                                    (write/out and read/in):              
* VAR - variable                                    .:KI.... or a key          
* ALT - alterator                                            from list: .'rwio 
* MSE - menu selection point                                                   
  ERR - error message                             change an value:                
  SEL - selecttion                                                .:SP....
-------                                                           .:DE....                                        
* - active lines, navigated
    with cursor keys
                                                  change mode: 
                                                              any key                
                                                              from list: .'0123
  Please,
  refer to 'man vhset' for full description

